              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na akamũetee Yeova nthembo yake ya ĩvĩtyo kwondũ wa naĩ yake ĩla wavĩtisye, kamwatĩ kana mbaika, kuma ndĩthyanĩ yĩthĩwe nthembo ya naĩ; na mũthembi akathembe nthembo ya kũmwĩw’anĩthya ũsu ũndũ wa naĩ yake.",
          "type": "text",
